{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"1813d263c26e831c2567d2bb1a86aceeba0ff4bca2eb75bd8e33b93483b09179","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我見日光之下有一宗禍患重壓在人身上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["就是人蒙上帝賜他資財、豐富、尊榮，以致他心裏所願的一樣都不缺，只是上帝使他不能吃用，反有外人來吃用。這是虛空，也是禍患。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["人若生一百個兒子，活許多歲數，以致他的年日甚多，心裏卻不得滿享福樂，又不得埋葬；據我說，那不到期而落的胎比他倒好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為虛虛而來，暗暗而去，名字被黑暗遮蔽，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["並且沒有見過天日，也毫無知覺；這胎，比那人倒享安息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那人雖然活千年，再活千年，卻不享福，眾人豈不都歸一個地方去嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["人的勞碌都為口腹，心裏卻不知足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這樣看來，智慧人比愚昧人有甚麼長處呢？窮人在眾人面前知道如何行，有甚麼長處呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["眼睛所看的比心裏妄想的倒好。這也是虛空，也是捕風。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["先前所有的，早已起了名，並知道何為人，他也不能與那比自己力大的相爭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["加增虛浮的事既多，這與人有甚麼益處呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["人一生虛度的日子，就如影兒經過，誰知道甚麼與他有益呢？誰能告訴他身後在日光之下有甚麼事呢？"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ECC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}